><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd></mjx-mtr></mjx-itable></mjx-table></mjx-mtable></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mtable displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"0.8em 0.8em 0.3em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mtext>d</mtext><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mtext>d</mtext><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>300</mn><msup><mi>csc</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">(</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.05</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mtext>d</mtext><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mtext>d</mtext><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>300</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.05</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mtext>d</mtext><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mtext>d</mtext><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>60.</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, the speed of the hot air balloon is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"232\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace styl